"""Build report.json from solution_raw.json (v2).

Startup cost uses the tier rule from the operating-rules skill: chosen tier is
the largest lag not exceeding the prior offline duration. Production cost uses
total-cost breakpoint interpolation. All constraint checks are recomputed
independently from the reported arrays before writing "pass".
